	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Summas tibi debeo gratias denuo, domine et compater <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>colendissime, tum pro his, quae nuper ad me scripsisti, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tum pro singularibus istis beneficiis, quibus nuper <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>filiam meam <persName>Delspergeram</persName> affecisti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Non potuit <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>illa mihi satis commendare et laudare, qua humanitate <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tu et generi tui, d. <persName ref="p8442">Simlerus</persName> et d. <persName ref="p7228">Zvin<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>glius</persName>, eam exceperitis, ita ut etiam domi tuae cum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>honestissimis filiabus tuis pernoctaverit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dominus rependat <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tibi et istis omnibus cuncta haec!</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego certe <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>impar sum, qui referre unquam possim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Caeterum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quod ad nos, laboramus adhuc sub manu domini, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>qui subinde aliquos ex coetu nostro evocat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Decessit <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>his diebus nobilissimus et honestissimus vir d. <persName>Wil<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>helmus a Diesbach</persName>, qui paulo ante ex praetura <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName>Muretensi</placeName> redierat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Decedunt et alii, non tamen <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ingenti numero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Familiae meae et socer dominus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>adhuc pepercit; ipsi sit laus in aeternum!</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Is deinceps <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quoque nos custodiat ab omni malo!</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quod <placeName ref="l832">Gallica</placeName> et <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudica</placeName> attinet, pendent ea ut prius.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Mitt <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ist es auch am alten jon.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Male metuo, ne aliquando <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tertius aliquis nos conciliet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quod <placeName ref="l648">Rheticum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>negotium concernit, rogant omnes, ut, quę deinceps ibi <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>fiunt, nobis quoque communices; verentur enim omnes, ne res haec <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tragicum tandem sortiatur exitum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l791">Valesiani</placeName> longe pru<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>dentius in electione sui episcopi egerunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nova <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>alias nulla habemus, nisi quarum tu quoque fecisti mentionem.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Scis d. <persName ref="p1049">Farellum</persName> obiisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3429">Vireto</persName> interdic<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tum, ut <placeName ref="l301">Lugduni</placeName> concionetur; quia tamen hoc suggest<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ione malorum effectum videtur, legati missi sunt, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>qui expiscentur an hoc a rege mandatum fuerit.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Missu<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>s etiam est a senatu quidam nobis <placeName>Erlacensis</placeName>, qui, ut illic <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>manere possit, senatus nostri nomine agat; is <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nondum est reversus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Audimus illi iterum concessum <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>esse concionari; non velle tamen eum, donec ex aula <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>redeant, qui regis authoritatem adferant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Galeatium <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Capellam Latine habeo, Germanicum, ut a <persName ref="p3700">Rüm<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>lango</persName> nostro versus et hic excusus est, apud biblio<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>polas nostros invenire nondum potui; si invenero <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>posthac aut si Latinum voles, mittam.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p4060">Zehenderus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>scribit tandem; amisit is ancillam his diebus ex peste.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/>D. <persName ref="p1884">Lavatero</persName> meo nomine, quaeso, agito gratias pro suo <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Iehosua ad me misso; laudo illius diligentiam; <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>percurrere tamen singula nondum licuit.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Fratribus illius prae<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>stabo, quicquid potero; <persName>Bernhardus</persName> iterum per aliquot dies decubuit <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>priore morbo, sed nunc melius habet.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Quod ad magistrum, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>etiam ibi melius eum habere audio quam antea.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Dic <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>etiam, rogo, d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvalthero</persName> me literas illius ad d. <persName ref="p8325">a Prato</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l425">Romano</placeName>, consulem <placeName ref="l922">Friburgensem</placeName>, curasse; ad quem si quid <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>denuo scribere velit, ad me mittat; nam mater huius, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>d. <persName>Wunderlichii</persName><note type="margin">a.R.: Vunderl.</note> relicta vidua, honestissima matrona, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nobiscum fere quotidie est et in religione, licet mor<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>tuo marito et filiis eam retrahere cupientibus, constantissime <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>pergit.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Dominus ipsam in finem usque confirmet et con<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>servet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te d. <persName ref="p8063">Steigerus</persName>, <persName ref="p3494">Diesbachius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/><persName ref="p3659">Mülinensis</persName>, socer, amici denique et fratres, mater item et uxor.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem di<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>c tuis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Dominus vos servet a malo!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 17a octobris 1565.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Tuus perpetuo <persName ref="p8018">Ioh[annes] Hallerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo vir<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>o d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, pastori ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>patri et compatri suo summa sem<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>per observantia colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>